  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save Moroccan Kids from Abandonment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project in Laayoune, Morocco provides training to 40 single mothers from disadvantaged areas to improve their living conditions and strengthen their technical and emotional capabilities. Classes and training in cooking, hair dressing, and dressmaking will help the mothers find employment or income-generating activities, and ensure the welfare of their children (100 children).The project aims to prevent child abandonment and exploitation, and involves partnerships with local association.</narrative>
  </description>
